    'PT/INR (Extrinsic VII + Common X, V, II, I) · aPTT (Intrinsic XII, XI, IX, VIII + Common) · Normal 1:1 Mixing Study corrects = Factor Deficiency; FAILS = Inhibitor (LA/FVIII Ab)',
