      'Normocytic anaemias split immediately by Reticulocyte Production Index: RPI < 2.0 (hypoproliferative CKD EPO loss, aplastic marrow, pure red-cell aplasia parvovirus B19) vs RPI > 2.0 (acute bleeding, extravascular spherocytes/G6PD/AIHA, or intravascular TTP/DIC schistocytes).',
